  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "de51cc75-aff7-4441-ad27-7464a3da25c7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<em>by Hideo Kojima</em>"
    },
    {
      "id": "f7a3aceb-428a-4874-b5cb-2a0af24da83a",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac3b0478-d7bc-43cf-b5e4-03239dc4f637",
      "type": "bookmark",
      "src": "https://www.kojimaproductions.jp/en/company#:~:text=We%20laugh%20together%20and%20cry,evolve%20the%20art%20of%20play",
      "title": "Company | Kojima Productions"
    },
    {
      "id": "eddd84c9-3b8c-4c68-a431-d9bff952faab",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "~"
    },
    {
      "id": "a74b5cb8-ad89-41fe-97cc-33dc1be79572",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "From Sapiens to Ludens<br>We are Homo Ludens (Those who Play)."
    },
    {
      "id": "cd0c19cc-a990-4d76-852c-b3c9126d6595",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "From the moment we enter this world,<br>We instinctively invent ways to have &quot;fun&quot;,<br>and share our inventions with those around us.<br>We are not asked to do this,nor do we need reasons to create.<br>It is simply who we are."
    },
    {
      "id": "bee213e5-fe02-46d6-bb6c-c8051f1e754b",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "We find one another and compete with one another.<br>We laugh together and cry together: all while playing together.<br>Our experiences bind us and liberate us.<br>To share our most valuable experiences,<br>we create stories, invent tools, and evolve the art of play.<br>Play has been our ally since the dawn of civilization."
    },
    {
      "id": "49117105-a54f-4bfa-b00f-9b6fd503de14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "&quot;Playing&quot; is not simply a pastime,<br>it is the primordial basis of imagination and creation.<br>Truth be told, Homo Ludens (Those who Play) are<br>simultaneously Homo Faber (Those who Create)."
    },
    {
      "id": "8b423fa5-4178-4ae3-9d17-e96222f869aa",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Even if the Earth were stripped<br>of life and reduced to a barren wasteland, our imagination and desire<br>to create would persevere beyond survival,<br>it would provide hope that flowers may one day bloom again.<br>Through the invention of play, our new evolution awaits."
    },
    {
      "id": "ffa5aa27-69d1-443a-9a55-f341ff07d41a",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "KOJIMA PRODUCTIONS <br>We are Homo Ludens. We are those who play."
    },
    {
      "id": "0ed42200-d360-4841-b1ba-6f7f58317c27",
      "type": "paragraph",
